OL,3,GNEWSAProperty event UKREiiF to leave
OL,4,ALeeds for Liverpool
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe decision to move a real estate
OL,7,Finvestment forum from Leeds to
OL,8,FLiverpool has been described as a "sad
OL,9,Fday" for the city by its co-founder.
OL,11,FUKREiiF - the UK's Real Estate
OL,12,FInvestment and Infrastructure Forum -
OL,13,Fhad been held at the Royal Armouries
OL,14,Fsince it launched in 2022, with more
OL,15,Fthan 17,000 delegates attending,
OL,16,Forganisers said.
OL,18,FThe Liverpool Experience Campus has
OL,19,Fobtained host rights from 2028, while
OL,20,Fnext year's event will still take place
OL,21,Fin Leeds from 18 to 20 May.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
