OL,3,GNEWSAProperty event UKREiiF to leave
OL,4,ALeeds for Liverpool
OL,5,
OL,6,FCo-founder Keith Griffiths said the
OL,7,Fevent had become "a pillar of the
OL,8,Fbusiness community, bringing national
OL,9,Fattention and significant income to the
OL,10,Flocal economy".
